godotengine/godot/issues/112768","id":3719877195,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7duNJL","user":{"login":"machinescreen","id":132695269,"node_id":"U_kgDOB-jE5Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132695269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen","html_url":"https://github.com/machinescreen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/machinescreen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T17:11:16Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T17:11:16Z","body":"I've done some further investigation of this and it seems a combination of #81872 (Add half-pixel offset to lightmapper rasterization) and #100765 (Add a supersampling option to LightmapGI) are causing this issue.\n\nIn master I reverted both those commits and the lightmap comes out as expected with the light centred on the plane, brightest section in the middle and everything symmetrical, exactly matching the output from 4.1.1.\n\n<img width=\"800\" height=\"398\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1d1af07-3354-4bee-8f67-568e760ea0f5\" />\n\nFor reference below is what the output looks like with each commit reverted invidually. It's interesting that #100765 is partially responsible as at no point in my testing have I even been using the supersampling option - but it appears that regardless of this it has caused a shift to the right (+X) by one texel.\n\n<img width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/650f1154-9da4-4656-a05e-ef8042ca0eb9\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3719877195/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]